<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>The Mirror</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
<canvas id="stage" role="img" aria-label="A dark space with a luminous geometric mirror reflecting your movement"></canvas>

<div class="hud">
  <header class="top">
    <div class="brand">
      <h1>THE MIRROR</h1>
      <p>Every action expects a response.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
      <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Experimental condition">
        <button type="button" data-cond="A" aria-pressed="true">A · Immediate</button>
        <button type="button" data-cond="B" aria-pressed="false">B · History</button>
      </div>
      <button type="button" id="btn-pause">Pause</button>
      <button type="button" id="btn-reset">Reset</button>
      <button type="button" id="btn-help" aria-label="Show instructions">?</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <footer class="bottom">
    <div class="readout">
      <span id="glyph" aria-hidden="true">○</span>
      <div>
        <strong id="state-name">Reflection</strong>
        <span id="state-note">Following you.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="memory-wrap">
      <ol class="memory" aria-label="Interaction history, most recent first">
        <li class="slot"><span class="arrow">–</span><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
        <li class="slot"><span class="arrow">–</span><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
        <li class="slot"><span class="arrow">–</span><span class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
      </ol>
      <span id="mem-label">Memory: off</span>
    </div>
    <p class="hint">Move · touch · arrows / WASD (Shift = stronger) &nbsp;|&nbsp; P pause · R reset · 1 / 2 condition</p>
  </footer>
</div>

<div id="paused-badge" hidden>PAUSED</div>

<section id="intro" class="overlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="card">
    <h2 id="intro-title">The Mirror</h2>
    <p>A luminous shape reflects you. Find out how your actions shape what it does next. There is no score and nothing to win.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Pointer:</b> move the cursor across the space.</li>
      <li><b>Touch:</b> drag a finger across the screen.</li>
      <li><b>Keyboard:</b> arrow keys or WASD to move; hold Shift for stronger movement.</li>
      <li><b>Pause briefly</b> between movements. Each movement that stops counts as one completed turn.</li>
      <li><b>P</b> pause/resume · <b>R</b> reset · <b>1 / 2</b> switch condition.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="small">Condition A: the mirror reacts only to what you do now. Condition B: it also remembers your last three completed movements. Switching condition restarts the attempt.</p>
    <p class="small">States are shown by shape and motion as well as colour: round = Reflection, hexagon = Adaptation, triangle or diamond = Divergence.</p>
    <button type="button" id="btn-begin">Begin</button>
  </div>
</section>

<div id="live" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></div>
<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
